<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-[#321E48] flex flex-col min-h-screen">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main class="flex-1 max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 w-full">
    <p class="uppercase text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#43637E] font-semibold mb-2">Bantuan cepat</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold mb-2">Tanya AI</h1>
    <p class="text-[#43637E] mb-8">
      Punya pertanyaan seputar stok, harga, atau jam buka? Tanya di sini, kasir virtual kami siap bantu.
    </p>

    <section class="border border-[#D9FFF4] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
      <div class="bg-[#321E48] text-white px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#65DCD5] text-[#321E48] flex items-center justify-center text-sm" aria-hidden="true">🤖</span>
        <span class="text-sm font-medium">Kasir Virtual Ariesta</span>
      </div>

      <div
        id="chat-box"
        class="h-72 overflow-y-auto p-4 space-y-3 bg-[#D9FFF4]/20"
        aria-live="polite"
      >
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#321E48] text-[#65DCD5] flex items-center justify-center text-xs shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">🤖</span>
          <p class="bg-white border border-[#D9FFF4] rounded-2xl rounded-tl-sm px-4 py-2 text-sm max-w-[80%]">
            Halo! Ada yang bisa dibantu soal stok, harga, atau jam buka toko?
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="px-4 pt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <button type="button" class="chat-suggestion text-xs border border-[#D9FFF4] text-[#43637E] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:border-[#65DCD5]">Jam buka toko?</button>
        <button type="button" class="chat-suggestion text-xs border border-[#D9FFF4] text-[#43637E] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:border-[#65DCD5]">Beras masih ada?</button>
        <button type="button" class="chat-suggestion text-xs border border-[#D9FFF4] text-[#43637E] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:border-[#65DCD5]">Bisa antar?</button>
      </div>

      <form id="chat-form" class="flex gap-2 p-4">
        <label for="chat-input" class="sr-only">Tulis pertanyaan</label>
        <input
          type="text"
          id="chat-input"
          name="message"
          required
          placeholder="Tulis pertanyaanmu..."
          class="flex-1 border border-[#D9FFF4] focus:border-[#65DCD5] focus:outline-none rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm"
        >
        <button type="submit" class="bg-[#321E48] text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-[#43637E] transition-colors">
          Kirim
        </button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <p class="text-xs text-[#43637E] mt-4">
      Balasan otomatis dari backend akan aktif di Sprint 2 — saat ini pesanmu langsung tampil di kotak chat.
    </p>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
